  // mouth) and one for Route 12 (before the gate house), each behind a flag of its own; this game shows Route 12's, as
  // part h did, so Route 11's and the three objects that only take up its tiles are held back and the cave is open. Its
  // key meets FireRed's, so it takes Johto's prefix (HgWorld.Clashes). Its trainers battle by their own records (Johto's
  // trainers.json)
